\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  My Saviour Jesus Spirit
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj and his soul to cleanse me thoroughly
\par His body that was crucified
\par should heal my body and spirit
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Look at the water from his ribs
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That which flowed from his pierced side
\par His blood should wash me completely
\par And give me peace within my soul.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Because of the sweat on his face
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 no one shall condemn me again
\par His life and the cross should urge me
\par And strengthen me to go forward.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O! Jesus Christ, listen to me
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 come, take me and hide me in you
\par should satan be annoyed with me
\par your bruises should defend me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Call upon me in time of death
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to come to you my father God
\par And I with all the Holy ones
\par \pard     shall sing your daily praises.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

